{
  "work_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam",
  "source_path": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam.json",
  "source_language": "chu",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-29",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.212v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "3b02b0c14d3bd324",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "A sermon by John Chrysostom for Holy Thursday. Truly I am distressed, overcome with dread."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.212v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "4c5364829af17e5b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "How shall I satisfy your thirst for hearing? What banquet of words shall I set before you?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.212v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "d9dec872e40454f2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "How shall I entertain so many people, whom Christ alone strives to satisfy?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.212v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "6150c0c60d35ab38",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For the joy of the whole world is already at the doors. The calm of the Lord’s resurrection is drawing near."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.212v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "c59df46fa09f3845",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Again the senseless Jewish people are in turmoil. Again the dogs bark at the shepherd."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.212v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "4f75926957662c66",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Again the servants plot against their master. Again the workers of darkness take counsel."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.212v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "52f6e22641d219b8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Again Judas rehearses his lawless betrayal."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.212v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "69f11f0d46ef1627",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Again the Jews prepare silver to send into Hades him who is free among the dead."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.212v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "7e8505a6e1a365d9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And they will learn that death is [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "6b51b54c16cfa719",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "So that the tombs may be shaken and the dead may be given wings to rise again. Again the disciple sells him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "f742f02baf78b8f4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And those trained in the law buy him. And the thief on the cross proclaims him God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "7f8924daeb9435ad",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But let us recall the betrayer’s words. “What are you willing to give me,” he said, “and I will hand him over to you?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "13a7e9a977919077",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "What are they willing to give you, foolish Judas? A rope to hang yourself,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "3f3df458f490b04c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "outer darkness, unquenchable fire, deprivation of the kingdom of God,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "de312c0d2e2f532a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "separation from the saints, a fall from which there is no rising. That was what you gained from the Jews through your bargain."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "6bcd47c42c8cbdc9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "What can they give you that could equal all you stand to lose, you lawless man, full of every evil?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "bdecd74d30374249",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Why do you sell so cheaply the Creator of heaven and earth, who carries everything in the palm of his hand?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "a0950cc48e51bd8e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When he saw his Master being honored, and saw costly ointment being poured upon his exalted head,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "1670d566991c7a2e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he reproached the woman who honored him and cried out, “Why this waste of ointment?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "32615b6865a81b26",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Why was this ointment not sold for three hundred denarii and the money given to the poor?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "e76905193bbd3cb5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "So you valued the ointment, prepared from various fragrances and skillfully blended, at three hundred denarii."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213r.s13",
      "source_sha256": "f3d97906b63a89f1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But the true ointment, whose fragrance raises the dead when they smell it, you sell for thirty pieces of silver."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213r.s14",
      "source_sha256": "555a9d6bc24e209a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You do not know what you are selling, Judas. The intoxication of greed has blinded you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213r.s15",
      "source_sha256": "f206f30761a2ad10",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When have you seen a master sold by his servant? When have you learned to sell"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "37d440c3d262e420",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "light in order to buy darkness? Why have you scorned the knowledge of love? Why do you carry out your betrayal with a kiss?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "d9397cca13e8c618",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Was it not rightly that the prophet exposed you, crying out from afar: “His mouth is full of curses,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "aa46176306dfb8de",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "bitterness, and deceit. Under his tongue are trouble and suffering.” Like a sharpened razor, you practiced deceit."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "c2263295a10849ab",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "You were kissing your own Master. Come forward and kiss him! The patient Master endures you,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "e9d21fc9cdb55568",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "not turning away from the foul stench of your kiss, but the gift he had given you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "db245a94d14830cd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "he was taking out of your mouth. Oh, how evil the love of money is!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "1078f34687e38a35",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "For because of it the disciple left the ranks of the apostles and took a rope to hang himself,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "4122e8259f54eac3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "and it showed its fitting power upon the throat through which the words of betrayal had come. But leaving this ungodly man behind,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "6dbfdbdd679eee06",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "let us turn our discourse to the godly robber. O ineffable light! For through it the robber leaped from the cross into paradise."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "0bcc09f09b41a40a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "For when he saw the Lord hanging in the middle, and the whole world shaking with fear,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "bdd8ba32a8c91469",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "and the sun being covered with terrible sorrow, and the light of day fleeing,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "24b3465c1ebf96f0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "and the fabric of creation casting off its order, and the rocks splitting apart—having seen all this and taken it to heart,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "a007a0aa38d969b9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "and not knowing what words to say to his fellow robber [?], and seeing all creation"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.213v.s14",
      "source_sha256": "daf116e455ed4cfb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "swaying this way and that and trembling, he recognized the one hanging in the middle as the Master of all that trembled. And recognizing him there,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.214r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "1af26421b78a1951",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "he immediately cried out: “Remember me, Lord, when you come into your kingdom.” Truly the robber became"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.214r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "ecec3b2ff08e4510",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "a worker of the eleventh hour. For he completed the work of the whole day of life."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.214r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "4cab211daf6b146c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "And although he was hired for only one hour, he worked well. He did not grow weary in faith."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.214r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "a9ceede9549e0607",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "He paid no attention to blasphemies or wounds; he disregarded the Jews’ insults."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.214r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "8e6b9c49405143d7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Taking the whole world as his teacher and recognizing the Master of the whole world, he offered him fitting worship."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.214r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "7a2e92e06887ecd5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "What did Christ, the giver of rewards, who loves to honor those who do good, do in return for this?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.214r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "9af6d8deaf191788",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "To the robber who had asked for things to come, he revealed this exceedingly great gift in a single hour."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.214r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "fdfb3edd830265a2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "When the robber said, “Remember me, Lord, when you come into your kingdom,” immediately the Master, Christ, answered, saying:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.214r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "c657321cca5ff04e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "“Truly I tell you, today you will be with me in paradise.” True is the scripture that says:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.214r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "48a0bc972c73ed2a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "“While you are still speaking, I will say: ‘Here I am.’” To this Christ and our God be glory and worship,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-feriam-quintam#Supr.214r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "f6a31d241ff09965",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "with the Father and the Holy Spirit, now and always and forever and ever. Amen."
    }
  ]
}
